Package: prexp
Title: Prescription Explorer for the English Prescribing Dataset
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Marcelo", "Katogui", , "60530366+mkatogui@users.noreply.github.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Katonométrica", role = c("cph", "fnd"))
  )
Description: A 'shiny' app over the English Prescribing Dataset, published
    monthly by the NHS Business Services Authority, backed by 'PostgreSQL'.
    It loads the monthly files, serves read-only queries to the app and
    exports reports.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/katonometrica/prexp
